{"id":27,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It burrows into the ground to create its nest. If hard stones impede its tunneling, it uses its sharp claws to shatter them and then carries on digging."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It loves to bathe in the grit of dry, sandy areas. By sand bathing, the Pokémon rids itself of dirt and moisture clinging to its body."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Its body is dry. When it gets cold at night, its hide is said to become coated with a fine dew."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"When its skin gets wrinkled from moisture, it heads for a volcano. It lies flat on a spot with a lot of geothermal heat and dries itself out."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It lives in areas of limited rainfall. When danger approaches, it curls up into a ball to protect its soft stomach."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It usually makes its home in deserts and arid zones, where rain does not fall. It digs holes to catch Bug-type Pokémon."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It can roll its body into a ball. It moves through the desert by rolling at high speeds."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Sandshrew has a very dry hide that is extremely tough. The Pokémon can roll into a ball that repels any attack. At night, it burrows into the desert sand to sleep."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Sandshrew’s body is configured to absorb water without waste, enabling it to survive in an arid desert. This Pokémon curls up to protect itself from its enemies."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Disliking water, it lives in deep burrows in arid areas. It can roll itself instantly into a ball."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"It burrows and lives underground. If threatened, it curls itself up into a ball for protection."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It digs deep burrows to live in. When in danger, it rolls up its body to withstand attacks."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"To protect itself from attackers, it curls up into a ball. It lives in arid regions with minimal rainfall."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"If it fell from a great height, this Pokémon could save itself by rolling into a ball and bouncing."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Sand Veil","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness in a sandstorm."},{"name":"Sand Rush","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in a sandstorm."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Yellow","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":27,"name":"Sandshrew","condition":null,"children":[{"id":28,"name":"Sandslash","condition":"Lv. 22 or Use Ice Stone","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,111],[3,40],[6,28],[9,205],[12,210],[15,229],[18,523],[21,129],[24,154],[27,97],[30,163],[33,91],[36,360],[39,14],[42,201],[45,89]],"machine":[332,97,133,34,280,523,174,91,38,414,89,283,203,263,206,374,264,360,667,282,141,67,232,341,189,398,182,156,157,317,328,201,815,421,214,479,191,446,707,444,164,241,162,129,14,36,851,168,675,404],"egg":[68,175,468,232,189,400],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me1-68","name":"Sandshrew","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Common","number":"68","artist":null,"img":"me1/68"},{"id":"sv6-97","name":"Sandshrew","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"97","artist":"Tetsu Kayama","img":"sv6/97"},{"id":"sv3pt5-27","name":"Sandshrew","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Common","number":"27","artist":"kodama","img":"sv3pt5/27"},{"id":"swsh8-131","name":"Sandshrew","set":"Fusion Strike","date":"2021-11-12","rarity":"Common","number":"131","artist":"Yuka Morii","img":"swsh8/131"},{"id":"sm12-137","name":"Alolan Sandshrew","set":"Cosmic Eclipse","date":"2019-11-01","rarity":"Common","number":"137","artist":"ryoma uratsuka","img":"sm12/137"},{"id":"mcd19-4","name":"Alo